    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99640084d294892ab35dc460",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『長く，永い……\nはるか向こうにまで続く，光――』",
      "source_fingerprint": "463492b104aa1d5470b35f325305812b1948c321f0cd1172a6a1d749a1463370",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e46c1cf874dd30feab5bdba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自分は，彼女が長を務める\n『遠征支援委員会』の部屋で，\n彼女と2人きりで向かい合っていた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d5815aee5c0b4bd1679f5e73d64865d14b47ffb2f8057003a630efa29573adf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35cc8f7a19297040d9ff3d0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦之旅が目指すもの。走る理由。\nそれを，改めて確認するために――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c284051fa0a3976a43c3fbafb53b2220fe4986059da9784bfb3b8fdbada5b45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce12c744ae82ea0cf6668fb9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "梦之旅が“アネゴ”と呼ぶ存在。\n……ステイゴールドは決して華やかな，\n勝利に満ち溢れたウマ娘ではなかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d19b25181c91fd19586f9e4bd46f6bad9add4ca39a01c61f0d7b0dec61da4c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8621fb6e173fb0113deebada",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "むしろ勝ちきれないレースばかりで，\n同じ時を走った才能あるウマ娘たちと比べて，\n戦績だけ見ればずっと地味だったのだろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b62133e4b1b887442b899ece7945f45efb7ccd223ffdc5aacdd3eb76a2f3393",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
