    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f65c643a3a3c48a28631b0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ステイゴールドは，長い長い旅をゆくように\nレースを走り続けた。\nどんな相手にも挑戦し続けた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31e20e4e423f877fc3970a79cd43342aeb39f4d937f542e4e9b19ea8aa02b19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1119/storytimeline_501119100.json",
      "json_path": [
